  "description": "If you’re looking to build a comfortable yet high-performance gravel bike that’s versatile enough for podium chasing and party pacing, the Flyway C DLX Frameset is a superb start. This carbon gravel bike frame is built with our Deluxe carbon layup for 150 grams weight savings over our standard carbon, with all the same great durability, stiffness, and ride quality. It also features our Class 5 VRS™ design, which cuts down on road chatter for a smooth ride. Flyway’s geometry puts you in a confident yet comfortable position for hard-charging on hardpack or picking lines through chunky two-track. Cargo mounts on the frame and fork offer plenty of space to stow your ride essentials for sprint efforts or all-day adventures. Just add your favorite components and take off.",
